<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8" standalone="yes"?><rss version="2.0" xmlns:atom="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom"><channel><title>MCP on ByF (BaiFan) · 每日深度思考</title><link>https://blog.baifan.site/tags/mcp/</link><description>Recent content in MCP on ByF (BaiFan) · 每日深度思考</description><generator>Hugo -- gohugo.io</generator><language>zh-cn</language><managingEditor>blog@baifan.site (ByF (BaiFan))</managingEditor><webMaster>blog@baifan.site (ByF (BaiFan))</webMaster><copyright>CC BY-NC 4.0</copyright><lastBuildDate>Mon, 20 Jul 2026 14:00:00 +0800</lastBuildDate><atom:link href="https://blog.baifan.site/tags/mcp/index.xml" rel="self" type="application/rss+xml"/><item><title>AI Agent 的 Skill 和 MCP，哪些值得装</title><link>https://blog.baifan.site/ai-agent-skills-mcp-review/</link><pubDate>Mon, 20 Jul 2026 14:00:00 +0800</pubDate><author>blog@baifan.site (ByF (BaiFan))</author><guid>https://blog.baifan.site/ai-agent-skills-mcp-review/</guid><description>&lt;p&gt;开源社区每天都在涌现海量 Agent 扩展与 MCP 服务，但超过九成的扩展在装上之后便永久吃灰。工具链的价值在于其调用契约与上下文开销是否可控。以下从长期实测的高频工具中按真实场景分类梳理。&lt;/p&gt;</description></item><item><title>MCP 协议：AI 工具互联的 USB-C</title><link>https://blog.baifan.site/claude-code-mcp-protocol/</link><pubDate>Fri, 12 Jun 2026 09:00:00 +0800</pubDate><author>blog@baifan.site (ByF (BaiFan))</author><guid>https://blog.baifan.site/claude-code-mcp-protocol/</guid><description>&lt;!-- more --&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;在 MCP 出现之前，每个 AI 工具集成都是一次&lt;strong&gt;定制开发&lt;/strong&gt;。想让 ChatGPT 连数据库？写一个插件。想让 Claude 调 GitHub API？写一个 Function Calling 定义。想让 Copilot 访问你的内部系统？写一个 Custom Tool。&lt;/p&gt;</description></item><item><title>MCP 实现 Claude Skills 渐进式披露：Skill in Anywhere</title><link>https://blog.baifan.site/mcp-claude-skills-progressive-disclosure/</link><pubDate>Fri, 26 Dec 2025 14:00:00 +0800</pubDate><author>blog@baifan.site (ByF (BaiFan))</author><guid>https://blog.baifan.site/mcp-claude-skills-progressive-disclosure/</guid><description>&lt;figure&gt;&#10; &lt;img&#10; class="my-0 rounded-md"&#10; loading="lazy"&#10; decoding="async"&#10; fetchpriority="auto"&#10; alt="Claude Code Skill in Anywhere"&#10; width="2560"&#10; height="1440"&#10; src="https://blog.baifan.site/pictures/note/claudecodeskills_hu_3030e75c3d7e5ea7.png"&#10; srcset="https://blog.baifan.site/pictures/note/claudecodeskills_hu_3030e75c3d7e5ea7.png 800w,/pictures/note/claudecodeskills_hu_48299efe0d2363fe.png 1280w"&#10; sizes="(min-width: 768px) 50vw, 65vw"&#10; data-zoom-src="https://blog.baifan.site/pictures/note/claudecodeskills.png"&#10; /&gt;&#10; &#10; &lt;figcaption&gt;Claude Code Skill in Anywhere&lt;/figcaption&gt;&#10; &lt;/figure&gt;&#10;&#10;&lt;h1 class="relative group"&gt;利用 MCP 实现 Claude Skills 的渐进式披露机制: 复用 Claude Code Skill in Anywhere&#10; &lt;div id="利用-mcp-实现-claude-skills-的渐进式披露机制-复用-claude-code-skill-in-anywhere" class="anchor"&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&#10; &#10; &lt;span&#10; class="absolute top-0 w-6 transition-opacity opacity-0 -start-6 not-prose group-hover:opacity-100 select-none"&gt;&#10; &lt;a class="text-primary-300 dark:text-neutral-700 !no-underline" href="#%e5%88%a9%e7%94%a8-mcp-%e5%ae%9e%e7%8e%b0-claude-skills-%e7%9a%84%e6%b8%90%e8%bf%9b%e5%bc%8f%e6%8a%ab%e9%9c%b2%e6%9c%ba%e5%88%b6-%e5%a4%8d%e7%94%a8-claude-code-skill-in-anywhere" aria-label="锚点"&gt;#&lt;/a&gt;&#10; &lt;/span&gt;&#10; &#10;&lt;/h1&gt;&#10;&#10;&lt;h3 class="relative group"&gt;—— 一种可行的能力封装与动态上下文扩展方案（技术设想与验证）&#10; &lt;div id="-一种可行的能力封装与动态上下文扩展方案技术设想与验证" class="anchor"&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&#10; &#10; &lt;span&#10; class="absolute top-0 w-6 transition-opacity opacity-0 -start-6 not-prose group-hover:opacity-100 select-none"&gt;&#10; &lt;a class="text-primary-300 dark:text-neutral-700 !no-underline" href="#-%e4%b8%80%e7%a7%8d%e5%8f%af%e8%a1%8c%e7%9a%84%e8%83%bd%e5%8a%9b%e5%b0%81%e8%a3%85%e4%b8%8e%e5%8a%a8%e6%80%81%e4%b8%8a%e4%b8%8b%e6%96%87%e6%89%a9%e5%b1%95%e6%96%b9%e6%a1%88%e6%8a%80%e6%9c%af%e8%ae%be%e6%83%b3%e4%b8%8e%e9%aa%8c%e8%af%81" aria-label="锚点"&gt;#&lt;/a&gt;&#10; &lt;/span&gt;&#10; &#10;&lt;/h3&gt;&#10;&#10;&lt;h2 class="relative group"&gt;前言&#10; &lt;div id="前言" class="anchor"&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&#10; &#10; &lt;span&#10; class="absolute top-0 w-6 transition-opacity opacity-0 -start-6 not-prose group-hover:opacity-100 select-none"&gt;&#10; &lt;a class="text-primary-300 dark:text-neutral-700 !no-underline" href="#%e5%89%8d%e8%a8%80" aria-label="锚点"&gt;#&lt;/a&gt;&#10; &lt;/span&gt;&#10; &#10;&lt;/h2&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;Claude Skills 引入了一个非常先进的概念：&#10;&lt;strong&gt;将专业知识、流程规范和任务方法封装成“技能包”，并在任务实际需要时才动态加载。&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</description></item></channel></rss>